{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Do not fear.</b> That the child will be female, since the labor pains are severe — as our Sages of blessed memory said (Niddah 31a): the labor pains of a female are greater than those of a male." "<b>For this too is a son to you.</b> Even though his labor pains are severe, he too is male:"], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:23.816675596Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}